# SEO and GEO

- Take phone, address, license, service area, and credentials from `src/lib/business.js`. Do not invent reviews, awards, prices, or project statistics.
- Canonical host is `https://ldndecks.com` with no trailing slash. Do not change a public URL without a redirect and updated internal links.
- `src/app/robots.js` is the only robots source. Do not add `public/robots.txt`.
- Structured data must match the visible page. Do not put placeholder text in JSON-LD.
- Do not generate near-duplicate city or service pages to chase keywords.
- `llms.txt`, schema, and crawler access are discovery aids. Do not describe them as ranking or citation guarantees.
- A sitemap URL is not proof the URL is indexed. Missing Search Console access is not proof of zero traffic.
- Keep the financing UI wired. See `CLAUDE.md`.
- Before a production SEO change, run `npm run build` and `npm run seo:validate-schema`.
